Please pull before your next push. The review runs again on the new head.

<sub>Automated pre-review for `0fd14af42a0d`; it re-checks when the PR is updated.</sub>

You're right — I missed that existing warmup test in the previous run. Fixed in 892a4547 by initializing `generator.local_scheduler_process = None`. I reproduced the AttributeError before the change; the existing test now reaches the mocked client and passes.

I also checked all 8 manual `DiffGenerator` constructions across 6 test files and expanded validation to 15 related files: **388 passed, 2 skipped**. That includes the full warmup file, layered outputs, ComfyUI, shutdown, cancellation, and plugin startup. The bootstrap tests need automatic platform selection rather than the CPU override; rerunning them that way gave 6/6 passing. I've documented the split and exact test commands in the PR.

@BBuf could you take another look at this head when you have a chance?

